   266	exactly what the printed one-line citation lacked.  It **selects** q̃ (the
   267	unique hanging vertex), it **computes** the two determinants that the printed
   268	route needed, and it **routes around** Lemmas 2.3/2.4 altogether: the missing
   269	implication is supplied by Lemma 2.12, which is in the same section, proved,
   270	and independent.  In particular the residual that the replay flagged — that
   271	Lemma 3.7 b) supplies positivity only for the branch not containing h⁰ — is
   272	dissolved, not patched: (F1) supplies determinant **1** for the other
   273	candidate branches, and both candidates are needed only as a floor
   274	(`det B ⩾ 1`), never as an attainment.
