   392	k_up = k_down = 1: **h̃ carries exactly one U⁰-component**, namely B.  But g̃₁
   393	is incident to some U⁰-component, which by Corollary 3.8 a) attaches at a
   394	vertex of h⁰ = {h̃}; so g̃₁ is incident to B ⊆ Δ, contradicting the hypothesis
   395	that Δ is non-incident to g̃₁.  Hence B2 does not occur. ∎
