+## Executive Verdict
+
+Item verdicts:
+
+```text
+(1) Theorem R1/R1'                         CONFIRMED
+(2) Theorem R2                              CONFIRMED
+    Theorem R2'                             REPAIRED-DIFFERENTLY
+(3) NEW-LEMMA[DET-LINF-NONPOS]              CONFIRMED
