+If `q~ = h~`, the repair correctly separates the two numerical possibilities.
+When `n(h~)=1`, `det(h~ g2~)=1`, and Lemma 2.12 again contradicts
+`v~ in Q3`.  When `n(h~)=2`, the case is empty: the local degree formula and
